	(text "1. need guitar input (and footprint)\n2. need usb-c connector (and footprint)\n3. need footprints for the control system (?)\n4. need to add battery switch (and footprint)\n5. investigate component choices, ie ratings\n6.  input filter on adc has two cpacitors, change to 0 ohm resistors with DNI values"
